---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Terms of Use | Kvisl" description="Terms governing access to and use of the Kvisl website.">
  <main class="container page-main narrow-page">
    <p class="eyebrow">Policy</p>
    <h1 class="page-title">Terms of Use</h1>
    <p class="policy-updated">Last updated 19 September 2026</p>

    <div class="policy-copy">
      <p>By accessing or using this website, you agree to use it lawfully and in a way that does not interfere with the publication, its infrastructure, its authors, or other readers.</p>

      <h2>Reading, linking, and quotation</h2>
      <p>You may read the site, share links, and quote reasonable excerpts when the quotation preserves context and clearly identifies the author, article title, and <span class="notranslate" translate="no">Kvisl</span> as the source.</p>

      <h2>Uses that require permission</h2>
      <p>Full republication, translation, adaptation, syndication, commercial reuse, dataset creation from article text, and substantial reproduction require prior written permission. Republication is licensed separately and starts at US$600 per article; the final fee may vary by work, rights, territory, language, medium, duration, and the original author's terms.</p>

      <h2>Prohibited conduct</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>do not scrape, mirror, crawl, or copy the site at a scale that disrupts service or substitutes for the publication;</li>
        <li>do not bypass access controls, probe vulnerabilities, introduce malicious code, or interfere with site operation;</li>
        <li>do not impersonate <span class="notranslate" translate="no">Kvisl</span>, its authors, editors, or partners;</li>
        <li>do not remove copyright notices, credits, or source attribution;</li>
        <li>do not use the site or its content for unlawful, deceptive, or infringing activity.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Third-party services and links</h2>
      <p>The site may link to third-party websites or use third-party infrastructure. Those services have their own terms and privacy practices, and <span class="notranslate" translate="no">Kvisl</span> does not control their availability or content.</p>

      <h2>No professional advice</h2>
      <p>Articles are published for general reading, commentary, research, and cultural discussion. They are not medical, legal, financial, investment, or other professional advice.</p>

      <h2>Availability and changes</h2>
      <p>We may change, suspend, remove, or reorganise site features and content. We do not promise uninterrupted or error-free availability.</p>

      <h2>Responsibility</h2>
      <p>Use of the site is at your own risk to the extent permitted by applicable law. Nothing in these terms excludes rights or liabilities that cannot legally be excluded.</p>

      <h2>Policy updates</h2>
      <p>We may revise these terms when the publication, technology, or legal requirements change. Continued use after an update means the revised terms apply from their published effective date.</p>
    </div>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>
